  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1d683e9282ff5642729714e31b4f678b7c69bec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1d683e9282ff5642729714e31b4f678b7c69bec\" data-origin-width=\"719\" data-origin-height=\"696\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be8861619bcd4b1855ce39f7a4b301ce644b6398\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be8861619bcd4b1855ce39f7a4b301ce644b6398\" data-origin-width=\"719\" data-origin-height=\"593\"></div><p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">선생님도</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">아래의 챗봇으로 실습해보세요~<br>&#160;<br><b>&lt;챗봇 사용법&gt;</b><br>1. 대화 스타터(네모 상자 모양)를 클릭하기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/61a659daf245b8bc96280a2d1edd35d0919d982b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"392\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/61a659daf245b8bc96280a2d1edd35d0919d982b\" data-origin-width=\"497\" data-origin-height=\"208\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">2. 학생의 말이 자동으로 등장함<br>3. 해당 말에 대해 교사의 대답을 작성함<br>4. 대답에 대해 전문가의 피드백을 제공해줌<br>5. 계속 실습을 하고 싶다면 : &#39;다른 예&#39; 라고 입력함<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>그럼<br>아래의 링크를 클릭해서<br>실습을 시작해보세요~</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br><a href=\"https://chatgpt.com/g/g-68500ef613048191b6359f97ccc9388a-jihyeroun-gyosaneun-eoddeohge-malhaneunga-silseubpyeon\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://chatgpt.com/g/g-68500ef613048191b6359f97ccc9388a-jihyeroun-gyosaneun-eoddeohge-malhaneunga-silseubpyeon</a>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
